<title>FRANCE: Rhone-Poulenc placement completed - bank.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc placement completed - bank.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Societe Generale said it had completed the placement of 14.9 million shares in chemicals group Rhone-Poulenc for the account of the CDR holding.</p>
<p>CDR, the agency grouping the assets to be sold of state bank Credit Lyonnais, said earlier on Thursday that it sold 14.9 million Rhone-Poulenc shares, or a 4.6 percent stake, to institutional investors.</p>
</text>
